Hi Chiara,

You can try the below code.

library(dartR)
# test dataset
t1 <- platypus.gl <http://platypus.gl>
# reporting missing data by individual
gl.report.callrate(t1,method = "ind")
# defining individuals to drop
ind_list <- c("T26","T5")
# droping individuals
t2 <- gl.drop.ind(t1,ind.list = ind_list)

Cheers,
Luis

